---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Projects — Karan Ravindra"
  description="Selected software, machine learning, and data projects by Karan Ravindra."
>
  <header class="projects-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Special section · The workshop</p>
    <h1>Projects built to answer a question.</h1>
    <div class="projects-intro">
      <p class="standfirst">
        Experiments in useful interfaces, applied machine learning, and the
        infrastructure that turns an idea into something you can touch.
      </p>
      <p class="issue-note">
        <span>Current issue</span>
        Four interactive experiments spanning discriminative and generative models.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="project-ledger" aria-label="Selected projects">
    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-number">Project No. 001</div>
      <div class="project-copy">
        <p class="dateline">Machine Learning · Interactive</p>
        <h2>MNIST Digit Recognizer</h2>
        <p class="project-deck">
          A tiny convolutional neural network tries to identify the digit you
          draw—live, in the browser, and with no server round trip.
        </p>
        <p>
          The model was trained with PyTorch on QMNIST, exported to ONNX, and
          wired into a deliberately simple canvas interface. The result is less
          a polished product than a transparent field test: draw, watch, revise.
        </p>
        <a class="story-link" href="/projects/mnist">Open the live desk</a>
      </div>
      <div class="project-aside">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Medium</dt><dd>Web experiment</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Model</dt><dd>CNN / ONNX</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Input</dt><dd>32 × 32 pixels</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Live</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="live-mark"><span></span> Running in browser</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="new-projects" aria-labelledby="new-projects-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="new-projects-heading">New from the lab</p>
    <div class="brief-grid">
      <article class="project-brief">
        <p class="project-number">Project No. 002</p>
        <p class="dateline">Sequence Models · Interactive</p>
        <h2>Baby Name Generator</h2>
        <p>
          A gender-conditioned RNN/LSTM concept that invents names one character
          at a time. The current edition uses synthetic syllables and scores.
        </p>
        <div class="brief-meta"><span>RNN / LSTM</span><span>Mock data</span></div>
        <a class="story-link" href="/projects/name-generator">Open the naming desk</a>
      </article>

      <article class="project-brief">
        <p class="project-number">Project No. 003</p>
        <p class="dateline">Generative Models · Interactive</p>
        <h2>MNIST Image Generator</h2>
        <p>
          Choose a target digit and sample a sheet of imagined handwriting from
          a placeholder latent space, complete with diversity controls.
        </p>
        <div class="brief-meta"><span>Generator</span><span>Mock samples</span></div>
        <a class="story-link" href="/projects/mnist-generator">Generate a specimen sheet</a>
      </article>

      <article class="project-brief">
        <p class="project-number">Project No. 004</p>
        <p class="dateline">Interpretability · Interactive</p>
        <h2>MNIST DINO Visualizer</h2>
        <p>
          Inspect simulated attention heads across transformer layers to see
          which parts of a handwritten digit attract the model’s focus.
        </p>
        <div class="brief-meta"><span>DINO / ViT</span><span>Mock attention</span></div>
        <a class="story-link" href="/projects/mnist-dino">Inspect the attention desk</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="archive-note">
    <p class="section-label">From the editor</p>
    <blockquote>
      “The archive is intentionally selective. I would rather publish one
      working thing than ten case-study thumbnails.”
    </blockquote>
    <p>— Karan</p>
  </aside>
</Base>

<style>
  .projects-header {
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-bottom: 4px double var(--rule);
  }

  .projects-header h1 {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0.2em 0 0.3em;
    font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 6vw, 6.25rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    line-height: 0.83;
  }

  .projects-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 0.5fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .standfirst {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.3vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .issue-note {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .issue-note span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 900 0.64rem/1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .project-ledger {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .project-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, 0.35fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0;
  }

  .project-number {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  }

  .project-copy h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0.1em 0 0.35em;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.86;
  }

  .project-deck {
    max-width: 800px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .project-copy > p:not(.dateline, .project-deck) {
    max-width: 700px;
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .project-aside {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .project-aside dl {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-aside dl > div {
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa292;
  }

  .project-aside dt {
    font: 900 0.6rem/1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .project-aside dd {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .live-mark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 900 0.62rem/1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .live-mark span {
    width: 0.55rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgb(159 43 32 / 12%);
  }

  .archive-note {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .new-projects {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .brief-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 4px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .project-brief {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .project-brief:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .project-brief .project-number {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    writing-mode: initial;
  }

  .project-brief h2 {
    margin: 0.15em 0 0.45em;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 3.1rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .project-brief > p:not(.project-number, .dateline) {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .brief-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: auto 0 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .brief-meta span {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--ink);
    font: 900 0.56rem/1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .archive-note blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .archive-note > p:last-child {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 900 0.7rem/1 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .projects-intro,
    .project-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .projects-header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 17vw, 5.8rem);
    }

    .projects-intro {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .project-number {
      writing-mode: initial;
    }

    .project-aside {
      padding: 1rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .project-copy > p:not(.dateline, .project-deck) {
      columns: 1;
    }

    .brief-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .project-brief,
    .project-brief:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .project-brief:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (orientation: portrait) {
    .projects-intro,
    .project-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .projects-header h1 {
      max-width: 12ch;
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 10vw, 5.4rem);
    }

    .projects-intro {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .project-card {
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .project-number {
      writing-mode: initial;
    }

    .project-aside {
      padding: 1rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .brief-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .project-brief,
    .project-brief:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
  }

  @media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 720px) {
    .projects-header {
      padding-bottom: 2.75rem;
    }

    .projects-header h1 {
      max-width: 16ch;
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 5vw, 5.25rem);
    }
  }
</style>
